+- With twelve busy loops through a single-page copy of `scripts/run-specs.sh`,
+  `spec/entity/drug.md` passed 15 Bash blocks.
+- With twelve busy loops through a single-page copy of `scripts/run-specs.sh`,
+  `spec/entity/gene.md` passed 22 Bash blocks.
